{"seq":4,"slug":"image-generation-pipeline","title":"图像生成管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/text-to-image/image-generation-pipeline","wordCount":1182,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"图像生成管线\">图像生成管线</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>构建生产级图像生成管线需要将模型推理、提示词工程、参数调优、后处理和质量控制整合为一个端到端的工作流。管线不仅要生成高质量图像，还需要处理批量请求、管理 GPU 资源、缓存模型权重和监控生成质量。从单次推理到生产部署，工程复杂度往往远超模型本身。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[用户输入] --&gt; B[提示词优化]&#10;    B --&gt; C[参数配置]&#10;    C --&gt; D[模型推理]&#10;    D --&gt; E[后处理]&#10;    E --&gt; F[质量检查]&#10;    F --&gt; G{合格?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[输出图像]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| B\">graph LR\n    A[用户输入] --&gt; B[提示词优化]\n    B --&gt; C[参数配置]\n    C --&gt; D[模型推理]\n    D --&gt; E[后处理]\n    E --&gt; F[质量检查]\n    F --&gt; G{合格?}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[输出图像]\n    G --&gt;|否| B</pre><p>完整的图像生成管线涉及多个工程环节，每个环节都会影响最终结果的质量和一致性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>核心任务</th>\n<th>关键技术</th>\n<th>常见问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提示词工程</td>\n<td>构造高质量提示词</td>\n<td>模板化、LLM 增强</td>\n<td>语义模糊、属性冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参数配置</td>\n<td>选择最优超参数</td>\n<td>网格搜索、经验规则</td>\n<td>过饱和、细节缺失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型推理</td>\n<td>GPU 高效推理</td>\n<td>半精度、批处理、编译</td>\n<td>显存溢出、延迟过高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后处理</td>\n<td>提升输出质量</td>\n<td>超分、面部修复、去噪</td>\n<td>伪影放大、过度锐化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量控制</td>\n<td>自动化质量评估</td>\n<td>CLIP Score、审美评分</td>\n<td>误判、主观性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"提示词工程与优化策略\">提示词工程与优化策略</h2><p>提示词是控制生成结果的主要界面。有效的提示词工程需要理解模型的&quot;语言&quot;——不同模型对关键词的敏感度和理解方式存在差异。通用的提示词结构包括：主体描述（核心内容）、场景和环境（上下文）、风格和质量修饰（美学控制）以及技术参数（相机、光照）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class PromptBuilder:&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        self.quality_tokens = [&#10;            &quot;masterpiece&quot;, &quot;best quality&quot;, &quot;highly detailed&quot;,&#10;            &quot;sharp focus&quot;, &quot;professional&quot;, &quot;8k uhd&quot;&#10;        ]&#10;        self.negative_default = (&#10;            &quot;worst quality, low quality, blurry, distorted, &quot;&#10;            &quot;deformed, ugly, bad anatomy, watermark, text, signature&quot;&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    def build(self, subject, scene=&quot;&quot;, style=&quot;&quot;, quality_level=&quot;high&quot;):&#10;        parts = [subject]&#10;        if scene:&#10;            parts.append(scene)&#10;        if style:&#10;            parts.append(style)&#10;        if quality_level == &quot;high&quot;:&#10;            parts.extend(self.quality_tokens[:4])&#10;        elif quality_level == &quot;ultra&quot;:&#10;            parts.extend(self.quality_tokens)&#10;        return &quot;, &quot;.join(parts)&#10;&#10;    def enhance_with_llm(self, simple_prompt, style_hint=&quot;photorealistic&quot;):&#10;        system = f&quot;Enhance this image prompt for a {style_hint} style. Add details about lighting, composition, and quality. Keep it under 77 tokens.&quot;&#10;        return f&quot;{simple_prompt}, {style_hint}, detailed, high quality&quot;&#10;&#10;builder = PromptBuilder()&#10;prompt = builder.build(&#10;    subject=&quot;a golden retriever puppy playing in autumn leaves&quot;,&#10;    scene=&quot;in a sunlit park with tall oak trees&quot;,&#10;    style=&quot;cinematic lighting, warm color palette&quot;,&#10;    quality_level=&quot;ultra&quot;&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PromptBuilder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.quality_tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"masterpiece\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"best quality\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"highly detailed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"sharp focus\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"professional\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"8k uhd\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.negative_default </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"worst quality, low quality, blurry, distorted, \"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"deformed, ugly, bad anatomy, watermark, text, signature\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, subject, scene</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, style</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, quality_level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        parts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [subject]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scene:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            parts.append(scene)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> style:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            parts.append(style)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quality_level </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            parts.extend(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.quality_tokens[:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        elif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quality_level </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ultra\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            parts.extend(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.quality_tokens)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \", \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.join(parts)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> enhance_with_llm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, simple_prompt, style_hint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"photorealistic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        system </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Enhance this image prompt for a </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">style_hint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> style. Add details about lighting, composition, and quality. Keep it under 77 tokens.\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">simple_prompt</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">style_hint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, detailed, high quality\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">builder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PromptBuilder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> builder.build(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    subject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"a golden retriever puppy playing in autumn leaves\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    scene</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"in a sunlit park with tall oak trees\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    style</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cinematic lighting, warm color palette\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    quality_level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ultra\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>提示词权重语法（如 <code>(keyword:1.3)</code> 增强、<code>[keyword]</code> 减弱）在 A1111 和 ComfyUI 等前端中广泛使用。权重调整的原理是在交叉注意力中缩放特定 token 的嵌入向量范数。过高的权重（&gt;1.5）通常导致伪影，建议在 0.8-1.3 范围内微调。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推理优化与资源管理\">推理优化与资源管理</h2><p>生产环境中的推理优化涉及模型加载策略、精度选择、批处理设计和硬件利用率最大化。FP16 半精度推理在几乎不损失质量的情况下将显存占用和计算时间减半。torch.compile 和 xFormers 的内存高效注意力实现可以进一步提升速度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 推理优化策略&#10;        A[FP16 半精度] --&gt; E[基础优化]&#10;        B[xFormers 注意力] --&gt; E&#10;        C[torch.compile] --&gt; E&#10;        E --&gt; F[进阶优化]&#10;        D[VAE 切片] --&gt; F&#10;        G[注意力切片] --&gt; F&#10;        F --&gt; H[极致优化]&#10;        I[TensorRT 编译] --&gt; H&#10;        J[模型量化] --&gt; H&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 推理优化策略\n        A[FP16 半精度] --&gt; E[基础优化]\n        B[xFormers 注意力] --&gt; E\n        C[torch.compile] --&gt; E\n        E --&gt; F[进阶优化]\n        D[VAE 切片] --&gt; F\n        G[注意力切片] --&gt; F\n        F --&gt; H[极致优化]\n        I[TensorRT 编译] --&gt; H\n        J[模型量化] --&gt; H\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from diffusers import StableDiffusionPipeline, DPMSolverMultistepScheduler&#10;import torch&#10;&#10;class InferencePipeline:&#10;    def __init__(self, model_id, device=&quot;cuda&quot;):&#10;        self.pipe = StableDiffusionPipeline.from_pretrained(&#10;            model_id, torch_dtype=torch.float16, variant=&quot;fp16&quot;&#10;        ).to(device)&#10;        self.pipe.scheduler = DPMSolverMultistepScheduler.from_config(&#10;            self.pipe.scheduler.config&#10;        )&#10;        self.pipe.enable_xformers_memory_efficient_attention()&#10;        self.pipe.enable_vae_slicing()&#10;        self.pipe.enable_vae_tiling()&#10;&#10;    def generate_batch(self, prompts, negative_prompt, **kwargs):&#10;        results = []&#10;        for prompt in prompts:&#10;            image = self.pipe(&#10;                prompt=prompt,&#10;                negative_prompt=negative_prompt,&#10;                num_inference_steps=kwargs.get(&quot;steps&quot;, 25),&#10;                guidance_scale=kwargs.get(&quot;cfg&quot;, 7.5),&#10;                width=kwargs.get(&quot;width&quot;, 512),&#10;                height=kwargs.get(&quot;height&quot;, 512),&#10;                generator=torch.Generator(&quot;cuda&quot;).manual_seed(kwargs.get(&quot;seed&quot;, -1)),&#10;            ).images[0]&#10;            results.append(image)&#10;        return results&#10;&#10;    def warmup(self):&#10;        self.pipe(&quot;warmup&quot;, num_inference_steps=1, output_type=&quot;latent&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diffusers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> StableDiffusionPipeline, DPMSolverMultistepScheduler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#242