n class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pipe(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"warmup\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">num_inference_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">output_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"latent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>模型权重缓存策略对于多模型切换场景至关重要。预加载常用模型到 GPU 显存（如果空间允许），使用 CPU offload 作为备选（<code>pipe.enable_model_cpu_offload()</code>），以及使用 sequential offload 支持超大模型（<code>pipe.enable_sequential_cpu_offload()</code>）。在多用户场景中，模型队列管理和请求调度是系统设计的核心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"后处理与质量增强\">后处理与质量增强</h2><p>原始生成结果通常需要经过后处理才能满足生产质量要求。常见的后处理步骤包括超分辨率放大（将 512 图像放大到 2048+）、面部修复（修复面部细节失真）、颜色校正和锐化处理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from PIL import Image, ImageEnhance, ImageFilter&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;class PostProcessor:&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        self.face_restorer = None&#10;        self.upscaler = None&#10;&#10;    def upscale(self, image, scale=2):&#10;        w, h = image.size&#10;        return image.resize((w * scale, h * scale), Image.LANCZOS)&#10;&#10;    def enhance_sharpness(self, image, factor=1.3):&#10;        enhancer = ImageEnhance.Sharpness(image)&#10;        return enhancer.enhance(factor)&#10;&#10;    def enhance_contrast(self, image, factor=1.1):&#10;        enhancer = ImageEnhance.Contrast(image)&#10;        return enhancer.enhance(factor)&#10;&#10;    def auto_color_correct(self, image):&#10;        img_array = np.array(image).astype(np.float32)&#10;        for c in range(3):&#10;            channel = img_array[:, :, c]&#10;            p2, p98 = np.percentile(channel, (2, 98))&#10;            img_array[:, :, c] = np.clip((channel - p2) / (p98 - p2) * 255, 0, 255)&#10;        return Image.fromarray(img_array.astype(np.uint8))&#10;&#10;    def pipeline(self, image):&#10;        image = self.auto_color_correct(image)&#10;        image = self.enhance_contrast(image)&#10;        image = self.enhance_sharpness(image)&#10;        return image\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> PIL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Image, ImageEnhance, ImageFilter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PostProcessor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.face_restorer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"colo