/span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"clip_score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"min_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.clip_score(image, prompt)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        w, h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> image.size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"clip_score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: score,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"clip_pass\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> thresholds[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"clip_score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"size_pass\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w, h) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> thresholds[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"min_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"overall_pass\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> thresholds[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"clip_score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(w, h) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> thresholds[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"min_size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在批量生成场景中，质量控制策略通常包括：生成多个候选图像后选择 CLIP Score 最高的；设置硬性阈值过滤明显低质量的结果；使用美学评分模型进行更精细的质量排序；以及人工抽检维护质量标准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((生成管线))&#10;    提示词工程&#10;      结构化模板&#10;      权重调整&#10;      LLM 增强&#10;    推理优化&#10;      FP16 半精度&#10;      注意力优化&#10;      模型缓存&#10;    后处理&#10;      超分辨率&#10;      面部修复&#10;      颜色校正&#10;    质量控制&#10;      CLIP Score&#10;      美学评分&#10;      NSFW 检测\">mindmap\n  root((生成管线))\n    提示词工程\n      结构化模板\n      权重调整\n      LLM 增强\n    推理优化\n      FP16 半精度\n      注意力优化\n      模型缓存\n    后处理\n      超分辨率\n      面部修复\n      颜色校正\n    质量控制\n      CLIP Score\n      美学评分\n      NSFW 检测</pre><ul>\n<li>提示词工程是控制生成结果最直接的手段，结构化模板和权重调整是核心技巧</li>\n<li>FP16 推理、xFormers 注意力和 VAE 切片是基础的推理优化策略</li>\n<li>超分辨率和面部修复是最常用的后处理步骤，需注意伪影放大风险</li>\n<li>自动化质量控制通过 CLIP Score 和美学评分实现批量生成的质量保证</li>\n<li>生产级管线需要整合推理、后处理和质量控制为端到端的自动化工作流</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图像生成管线","id":"图像生成管线"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"提示词工程与优化策略","id":"提示词工程与优化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"推理优化与资源管理","id":"推理优化与资源管理"},{"level":2,"text":"后处理与质量增强","id":"后处理与质量增强"},{"level":2,"text":"质量控制与自动化评估","id":"质量控制与自动化评估"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"图像编辑技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/text-to-image/image-editing"},"next":{"title":"文本到视频生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/multimodal-generation/text-to-video"}}